<title>FINLAND: Outokumpu 1996 profit falls to FIM 229 mln.</title>
<headline>Outokumpu 1996 profit falls to FIM 229 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     229 vs 1,481</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.51 vs 8.72</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    1.00 vs 1.80</p>
<p> Net sales					 16,549 vs 16,952</p>
<p> Operating profit				   552 vs 1,589</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish mining and metals group Outokumpu Oy had been for a 298 million markka profit before extraordinary items and tax.</p>
</text>
